	(text "USB-C UPSTREAM — J3 receptacle, HD3SS3220 in UFP / GPIO mode, ESD\nGolden reference: datasheets/reference/ti-sllu241-hd3ss3220-ufp-dongle-evm.pdf, ti-slla481-hd3ss3220-schematic-checklist.pdf (run it before ERC)\nParts (LCSC): HD3SS3220RNHR C165155, USB-C 24P receptacle C2681555 / C456013, TPD4E05U06 C138714 (SS), USBLC6-2 C2687116 (D+/D-)\nStraps: PORT = L (UFP), ADDR open (GPIO mode), ENn_CC = L, VBUS_DET from VBUS through 900 kΩ. CURRENT_MODE don't-care.\nVBUS is detection only — never a power source. Keep the net name VBUS: kkh-analyze-schematic enforces < 10 µF on it.\nHierarchical pins US_SSTX/SSRX and US_DP/DM go to usb-hub (SSTX = hub transmits). Directive labels put them in USB3_SS / USB2_HS.\nConnector-side SS pairs (both orientations) also need USB3_SS directive labels when drawn.\nConsumes: +3V3, GND."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
